"rtl\">עֲלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:17\" href=\"/Genesis.44.17\">Gn 44:17</a> +; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹלֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:13\" href=\"/Genesis.38.13\">38:13</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹלֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.18\">Is 24:18</a> +, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:12\" href=\"/Genesis.28.12\">Gn 28:12</a> +, etc.;— <strong>1.</strong>  of persons, <em>go up, ascend</em>, in local relations: <strong>a.</strong>  from low place to high, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמִּצְרַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:25\" href=\"/Genesis.45.25\">Gn 45:25</a> (E) + 6 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מארץ מצרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:18\" href=\"/Exodus.13.18\">Ex 13:18</a> (E) + 3 times; †<span dir=\"rtl\">מִבָּבֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:6\" href=\"/Ezra.7.6\">Ezr 7:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:1\" href=\"/Ezra.8.1\">8:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן הירדן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:16\" href=\"/Joshua.4.16\">Jos 4:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:17\" href=\"/Joshua.4.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:19\" href=\"/Joshua.4.19\">19</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">ם(ן־ה)מדבר</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.6\">Ct 3:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.5\">8:5</a> etc. <strong>b.</strong>  out of a place, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן הארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.13\">1 S 28:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵהַבְּאֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.21\">2 S 17:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפַּחַת (תּוֹךְ)םִ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.18\">Is 24:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:44\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.44\">Je 48:44</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  c. acc. of place whither: a city <span dir=\"rtl\">ביתאל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:1\" href=\"/Genesis.35.1\">Gn 35:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:3\" href=\"/Gene